notes = "Accuracy D20 (story_boss). 3 PERMANENT PASSIVES: (1) ARCANE ABSORPTION - immune to Electric and absorbs it; Electric damage HEALS him instead, and no Electric element is ever applied to him, so Electric/Nature reactions cannot fire either direction. An Electro companion heals the boss every hit. (2) DIVINE THRESHOLD - no single action/ability may deal more than 100 damage; excess lost. (3) RETRIBUTIVE CIRCUIT - reflects 10% of damage dealt to him back at the dealer, unblockable. TWO INSTA-KILL GATES, one per phase - both are 'fail = every player dies, no save': (A) P1 ARCANE ANNIHILATION - a 2-round telegraphed charge starting when he first drops below 60% of Phase 1 HP (210); the party must deal 140 damage to him across those 2 rounds. Succeeding shatters the charge and STUNS him for 1 round. (B) P2 SETSUNA SHOUMETSU - summons a wave of 3 Nirvana Engine minions; the party has ONE round to destroy all 3, then a fresh wave spawns and it repeats. P1 Divine Ingenuity: upper body, 5 Elemental Matrices + stacking Remnant Flame / Raw Frost hazards; acts twice per round below 50% HP. P2 Nirvana Engines: 6 rotation abilities plus Setsuna. Boss is untargetable until the minion wave is cleared. The minions themselves (no HP - one Fire, one Ice, one Nature, each killed outright by a matching-element hit) are configured SEPARATELY and are not part of this record. Boss abilities carry cosmetic dice - enemy damage resolves as 4 x closest_die(diff) + 15."
